rightness: Up to 400 nits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1328\" />\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1352\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"446\">Audio &amp; Camera</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1117\">Front Camera: FaceTime HD 720p</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1117\">Microphones: Studio-quality three-mic array</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1117\">Speakers: Stereo speakers with Dolby Atmos support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1429\" />\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1458\"><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"592\">Ports</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"648\">2x Thunderbolt 3 (USB-C) ports</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"648\">3.5mm headphone jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1515\" />\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1539\">Battery</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1559\">Capacity : 49.9 Wh</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0.00, NULL, '1761809003_1.png', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0, '2025-07-21 10:07:34', '2026-05-01 13:30:39'),
(133, 133, 3, 'ipad-gen9-sold', 'iPad Gen9 — SOLD', '<p data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"256\"><strong>ชิปประมวลผล</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"256\">Apple A13 Bionic (6‑core: 2&times; Lightning + 4&times; Thunder ชิป 7 nm+) พร้อม Neural Engine</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"584\">หน้าจอ</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<li data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"608\">ขนาด: 10.2 Retina IPS LCD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"658\">ความละเอียด: ความละเอียด 2160&times;1620 พิกเซล</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"704\">ชนิด: Liquid Retina Display (IPS LCD)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"704\">รองรับ : True Tone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"704\">ความสว่าง : 500 nits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"867\">กล้อง</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"883\">กล้องหลัง :</h4>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"170\">ความละเอียดภาพนิ่ง:</strong><br data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"173\"><strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"200\">8 ล้านพิกเซล (8MP)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"228\">รูรับแสง: <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"226\">&fnof;/2.4</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"256\">ขนาดเซนเซอร์: ~1/3.2\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"289\">\r\n<p data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"289\">ซูมดิจิทัลได้สูงสุด 5 เท่า</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"332\">รองรับ HDR, autofocus, และ Live Photos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\" data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"358\">ความละเอียดวิดีโอ:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"403\">&nbsp;สูงสุด <strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"401\">1080p (Full HD) @ 30 fps</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"452\">รองรับวิดีโอ Slo‑mo ที่ <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"450\">720p @ 120 fps</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"503\">\r\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"503\">ระบบป้องกันภาพวิดีโอสั่น (video stabilization)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"361\">กล้องหน้า :&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"567\">ความละเอียดภาพนิ่ง:</strong><br data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"570\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"610\">12 ล้านพิกเซล (12MP Ultra Wide)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"638\">รูรับแสง: <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"636\">&fnof;/2.4</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"674\">มุมมองภาพ (FOV): <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"672\">122 องศา</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"729\">รองรับฟีเจอร์ <strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"709\">Center Stage</strong> (กล้องติดตามใบหน้า)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"755\">ความละเอียดวิดีโอ:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"810\">&nbsp;สูงสุด <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"808\">1080p (Full HD) @ 25 / 30 / 60 fps</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"868\">รองรับ HDR และวิดีโอแบบปรับตามใบหน้าผ่าน Center Stage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1209\">แบตเตอรี่</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1240\">ความจุ: 32.4 Wh (8,557 mAh)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1357\">พอร์ตเชื่อมต่อ &amp; การเชื่อมต่อ</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1412\">USB-C (แทน Lightning) &ndash; ความเร็ว USB 3.1 Gen 1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1439\">Wi‑Fi 802.11a</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1461\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1461\">Bluetooth 4.2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1535\">ช่องหูฟัง 3.5 มม.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"256\"><strong>Processor</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"256\"><strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"110\">Apple A13 Bionic</strong> (6‑core: 2&times; Lightning + 4&times; Thunder, 7 nm+ chip) with <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"181\">Neural Engine</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"584\">Display</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"240\"><strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"216\">Size</strong>: 10.2\" Retina IPS LCD</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"279\">\r\n<p data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"279\"><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"257\">Resolution</strong>: 2160 &times; 1620 pixels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"325\">\r\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"325\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"290\">Type</strong>: Liquid Retina Display (IPS LCD)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"362\">\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"362\"><strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"340\">Features</strong>: Supports True Tone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"391\"><strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"379\">Brightness</strong>: 500 nits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10jamv3\" data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"412\"><strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"412\">Camera</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"432\"><strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"429\">Rear Camera</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"480\">\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"455\">Photo Resolution</strong>: 📸 8 megapixels (8MP)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"504\"><strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"495\">Aperture</strong>: &fnof;/2.4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"533\"><strong data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"522\">Sensor Size</strong>: ~1/3.2\"</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"564\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"552\">Digital Zoom</strong>: Up to 5x</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"614\"><strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"579\">Features</strong>: HDR, autofocus, and Live Photos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"614\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">Video </span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"637\">Resolution</strong><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">:</span></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"677\">Up to 1080p (Full HD) @ 30 fps</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"723\">Supports Slo‑mo video at 720p @ 120 fps</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"759\">Video stabilization supported</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"780\"><strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"777\">Front Camera</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<li data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"838\"><strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"803\">Photo Resolution</strong>: 12 megapixels (12MP Ultra Wide)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"862\"><strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"853\">Aperture</strong>: &fnof;/2.4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"903\">\r\n<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"903\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"888\">Field of View (FOV)</strong>: 122 degrees</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"917\">Feature</strong>: Center Stage (face tracking)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"975\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"972\">Video Resolution</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1022\">Up to 1080p (Full HD) @ 25 / 30 / 60 fps</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1078\">Supports HDR and Center Stage face tracking video</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1209\">Battery</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1314\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1240\"><strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1117\">Capacity</strong>: 32.4 Wh (8,557 mAh)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1357\">Ports &amp; Connectivity</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1235\"><strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1189\">USB-C</strong> (replacing Lightning) &ndash; USB 3.1 Gen 1 speed</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1258\"><strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1247\">Wi‑Fi</strong>: 802.11a</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1281\"><strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1274\">Bluetooth</strong>: 4.2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1323\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1298\">Audio Jack</strong>: 3.5 mm headphone jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0.00, NULL, '/uploads/shop/2025/11/1762321419_______________________________________________________________________________.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0, '2025-07-29 06:39:24', '2026-06-11 12:33:24'),
(134, 134, 1, 'macbook-pro-13-2020-sold', 'MacBook Pro 13 “ (2020) —SOLD', '<p><strong>หน่วยประมวลผล (CPU)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>intel Core i5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>หน่วยความจำ (RAM)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>16GB แบบ Unified Memory (LPDDR4X)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>พื้นที่เก็บข้อมูล (SSD)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>SSD 512GB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>กราฟิก (GPU)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Intel Iris Plus Graphics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>หน้าจอ (Display)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ขนาด: Retina Display 13.3 นิ้ว</li>\r\n<li>เทคโนโลยี: True Tone</li>\r\n<li>ความสว่าง 500 นิต</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ระบบเสียง</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ลำโพงสเตอริโอพร้อมช่วงไดนามิกสูง</li>\r\n<li>เสียงสเตอริโอที่มีมิติเสียงกว้าง</li>\r\n<li>รองรับการเล่นคอนเทนต์ในระบบ Dolby Atmos</li>\r\n<li>ชุดไมโครโฟน 3 ตัว พร้อมบีมฟอร์มมิ่งตามทิศทางของเสียง</li>\r\n<li>ช่องต่อหูฟัง 3.5 มม.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>พอร์ต Thunderbolt 3 (USB‑C)</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>การชาร์จ</li>\r\n<li>DisplayPort</li>\r\n<li>Thunderbolt 3(สูงสุด 40Gb/s)</li>\r\n<li>USB 3.1 รุ่นที่ 2 (สูงสุด 10Gb/s)</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"67\"><strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"65\">Processor (CPU)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"85\">\r\n<li data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"85\">\r\n<p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"85\">Intel Core i5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"105\"><strong data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"103\">Memory (RAM)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"139\">\r\n<li data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"139\">16GB Unified Memory (LPDDR4X)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"160\"><strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"158\">Storage (SSD)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"174\">\r\n<li data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"174\">\r\n<p data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"174\">512GB SSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"196\"><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"194\">Graphics (GPU)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"225\">\r\n<li data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"225\">Intel Iris Plus Graphics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"240\"><strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"238\">Display</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"326\">\r\n<li data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"275\">Size: 13.3-inch Retina Display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"301\">Technology: True Tone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"326\">\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"326\">Brightness: 500 nits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"339\"><strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"337\">Audio</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"513\">\r\n<li data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"383\">Stereo speakers with high dynamic range</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"405\">Wide stereo sound</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"439\">Supports Dolby Atmos playback</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"488\">Three-mic array with directional beamforming</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"513\">\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"513\">3.5mm headphone jack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"550\"><strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"548\">Ports (Thunderbolt 3 / USB-C)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<li data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"566\">DisplayPort</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"599\">Thunderbolt 3 (up to 40Gb/s)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"632\">USB 3.1 Gen 2 (up to 10Gb/s)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"743\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>', 0.00, NULL, '/uploads/shop/2025/11/1762320674_1756459141_IMG_4086.jpg', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0, '2025-08-29 09:19:01', '2026-06-11 12:33:24'),
