(159, 159, 7, 'macbook-air-13-2024-m3-sold', 'MacBook Air 13\" (2024) M3 —SOLD', '<p class=\"p1\"><strong>หน่วยประมวลผล</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong>&nbsp;(CPU)</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Apple M3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>หน่วยความจำ</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong>&nbsp;(RAM)</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">16GB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>พื้นที่เก็บข้อมูล</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong>&nbsp;(SSD)</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">SSD 256GB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s3\"><strong>หน้าจอ</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;(Display)</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Liquid Retina: ขนาด 13.6 นิ้ว</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">ความละเอียด: 2560 x 1664 ที่ 224 pixels per inch</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">ความสว่าง: 500 nits</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">รองรับขอบเขตสีกว้าง (P3) และเทคโนโลยี True Tone</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>ระบบเสียง</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li5\">ลำโพง: ระบบเสียง 4 ลำโพง</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">ไมโครโฟน: ชุดไมโครโฟน 3 ตัว</li>\r\n<li class=\"li5\">ช่องต่อหูฟัง: 3.5 มม.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s3\"><strong>พอร์ต</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;Thunderbolt / USB 4&nbsp;</strong><span class=\"s3\"><strong>จำนวน</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;2&nbsp;</strong><span class=\"s3\"><strong>พอร์ต</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span class=\"s3\"><strong>ที่รองรับ</strong></span><strong>:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"list gb-list alignment horizontal-align-left\">\r\n<li class=\"gb-list_item\">\r\n<p class=\"gb-paragraph\">MagSafe 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"gb-list_item\">\r\n<p class=\"gb-paragraph\">Thunderbolt / USB c: จำนวน 2 พอร์ต</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Processor (CPU)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0\">Apple M3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Memory (RAM)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\">16GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Storage (SSD)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\">SSD 256GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Display</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">Liquid Retina: 13.6-inch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">Resolution: 2560 x 1664 at 224 pixels per inch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">Brightness: 500 nits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">Support for Wide color (P3) and True Tone technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Audio</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">Speakers: Four-speaker sound system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">Microphones: Three-mic array</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\">Headphone jack: 3.5 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Two Thunderbolt / USB 4 ports with support for:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\">MagSafe 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">Two Thunderbolt / USB-C 2 ports</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 24000.00, NULL, '/uploads/shop/2026/01/1768650891_IMG_0153.webp', NULL, NULL, 'published', 0, '2026-01-17 11:54:51', '2026-06-11 12:33:24'),
(160, 160, 7, 'macbook-air-13-2022-m2-sold', 'MacBook Air 13”(2022) M2 —SOLD', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">ปล่อยของ! MacBook Air M2 (2022) 13.6\" สภาพนางฟ้า แบตอึดๆ พร้อมใช้งาน</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">ครื่องศูนย์ไทย สภาพสวย ใช้งานถนอมมาก สเปคแรงๆ ทำงานลื่นปรื๊ด ใครหาอยู่คุ้มแน่นอนครับ!</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">สเปคเครื่อง (Specification):</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">- ชิปประมวลผล: Apple M2</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">- หน่วยความจำ (RAM): 8GB</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">- ความจุ (Storage): 256GB SSD</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">- หน้าจอ: Liquid Retina 13.6 นิ้ว สีสดคมชัด</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t5e/2/16/1f50b.png\" alt=\"🔋\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span> สภาพแบตเตอรี่ (โคตรดี ใช้งานได้อีกยาว):</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">สุขภาพแบตเตอรี่ (Maximum Capacity): 97% (ตีไปร้อยเลยยังได้!)</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">รอบชาร์จ (Cycle Count): แค่ 122 รอบเท่านั้น</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1